The Saturator, Dynamic Tube, Overdrive and Multiband Dynamics effects are native
ports of JSFX by Alessio Scala (version 1.0 of each), supplied for Atlas and kept
unmodified in tests/drive_dynamics; the scripts carry no licence statement. They
recreate devices from Ableton Live, modelled from measurements of the originals,
not from their code (src/synthesis/effects/drive_dynamics/README.atlas.md).

The Frequency Shifter's Mode 2 is a native port of the Serum 2 Bode JSFX by
Alessio Scala (version 1.0), supplied for Atlas and not included in this
repository; the script carries no licence statement. It recreates the Bode
frequency shifter of Xfer Records' Serum 2, modelled from measurements of the
original, not from its code (src/synthesis/effects/bode/README.atlas.md).

The Destroy effect is a native port of the Serum 2 Overdrive JSFX by Alessio
Scala (version 1.0), supplied for Atlas and not included in this repository;
the script carries no licence statement. It recreates the Overdrive mode of the
Distortion effect in Xfer Records' Serum 2, modelled from measurements of the
original, not from its code (src/synthesis/effects/destroy/README.atlas.md).

